<title>USA: Equus II holds 15.6 pct American stake.</title>
<headline>Equus II holds 15.6 pct American stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equus II Inc said Friday it holds a 15.6 percent stake in American Residential Services Inc or 1,321,035 common shares.</p>
<p>Equus disclosed its position on American Residential in a 13G filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company. Unlike 13D filings, those reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
